  <h1>Lesson 19: Forms Styling in CSS</h1>
  <p>Learn How to Style Inputs, Labels, Focus, Placeholder, Select & Beautiful Contact Forms | LearnHTMLCSSJS.com</p>
</header>

<div class="container">
  <div class="tabs">
    <button id="lessonTabBtn" class="tab-btn active" onclick="showLesson()">📖 Lesson</button>
    <button id="testTabBtn" class="tab-btn" onclick="showTest()">📝 Test - 100 Marks</button>
  </div>
  <div id="lockMsg" class="lock-msg">🔒 Test is running! All tabs are locked until you submit the test or time ends.</div>

  <div id="lessonContent">
    <h2>1. Why Style Forms?</h2>
    <p>Every website has a form - Login, Signup, Contact Us, Order Form, Search.</p>
    <p>If your form looks plain, people will not fill it. If it looks clean and modern, people will trust your website.</p>
    <div class="note"><b>Example:</b> Facebook Login form, Google Signup form, Daraz Checkout form - all are styled forms.</div>
    <h2>2. Normal Form vs Styled Form</h2>
    <div class="result"><b>Normal Form (No CSS - Ugly):</b><br><label style="display:block;margin:8px 0 3px">Name:</label><input type="text" placeholder="Enter name"><br><label style="display:block;margin:8px 0 3px">Email:</label><input type="email" placeholder="Enter email"><br><button style="margin-top:8px">Submit</button></div>
    <div class="result" style="margin-top:12px"><b>Styled Form (With CSS - Beautiful):</b><label class="demo-label">Your Name:</label><input class="demo-input" type="text" placeholder="Enter your full name"><label class="demo-label">Email Address:</label><input class="demo-input" type="email" placeholder="example@gmail.com"><button class="btn" style="width:100%;margin-top:12px">Send Message →</button><p style="margin:8px 0 0;font-size:13px;color:#64748b">Click inside the input box - see the blue border + glow! That is :focus effect.</p></div>
    <h2>3. Input Styling - Copy This Code</h2>
    <div class="code-box"><code>
<span class="tag">input</span> <span class="text">{</span><br>
&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class="attr">width</span><span class="text">:</span> <span class="val">100%</span><span class="text">;</span> <span class="comment" style="color:#94a3b8">/* Full width */</span><br>
&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class="attr">padding</span><span class="text">:</span> <span class="val">12px</span><span class="text">;</span><br>
&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class="attr">border</span><span class="text">:</span> <span class="val">2px solid #e2e8f0</span><span class="text">;</span><br>
&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class="attr">border-radius</span><span class="text">:</span> <span class="val">8px</span><span class="text">;</span><br>
&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class="attr">font-size</span><span class="text">:</span> <span class="val">16px</span><span class="text">;</span><br>
&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class="attr">outline</span><span class="text">:</span> <span class="val">none</span><span class="text">;</span> <span class="comment" style="color:#94a3b8">/* Remove default black border */</span><br>
&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class="attr">transition</span><span class="text">:</span> <span class="val">0.3s</span><span class="text">;</span><br>
<span class="text">}</span>
    </code></div>
    <h2>4. :focus - When User Clicks Input</h2>
    <p><b>:focus</b> means "When user clicks inside this input, change its style." This is the most important form effect.</p>
    <div class="code-box"><code>
<span class="tag">input:focus</span> <span class="text">{</span><br>
&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class="attr">border-color</span><span class="text">:</span> <span class="val">#2563eb</span><span class="text">;</span> <span class="comment" style="color:#94a3b8">/* Blue border on click */</span><br>
&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class="attr">box-shadow</span><span class="text">:</span> <span class="val">0 0 0 3px #dbeafe</span><span class="text">;</span> <span class="comment" style="color:#94a3b8">/* Light blue glow */</span><br>
<span class="text">}</span><br><br>
<span class="comment" style="color:#94a3b8">/* Placeholder - Light grey hint text */</span><br>
<span class="tag">input::placeholder</span> <span class="text">{</span><br>
&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class="attr">color</span><span class="text">:</span> <span class="val">#94a3b8</span><span class="text">;</span><br>
<span class="text">}</span>
    </code></div>
    <div class="result"><b>Result - Click Inside:</b><label class="demo-label">Try Me:</label><input class="demo-input" type="text" placeholder="Click me - border becomes blue + glow"></div>
    <h2>5. Label Styling</h2>
    <p><b>Label</b> is the text above the input - like "Your Name:", "Email:". Always style it bold and with space.</p>
    <div class="code-box"><code>
<span class="tag">label</span> <span class="text">{</span><br>
&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class="attr">display</span><span class="text">:</span> <span class="val">block</span><span class="text">;</span> <span class="comment" style="color:#94a3b8">/* Label on its own line */</span><br>
&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class="attr">font-weight</span><span class="text">:</span> <span class="val">bold</span><span class="text">;</span><br>
&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class="attr">margin-bottom</span><span class="text">:</span> <span class="val">5px</span><span class="text">;</span><br>
&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class="attr">color</span><span class="text">:</span> <span class="val">#0f172a</span><span class="text">;</span><br>
<span class="text">}</span>
    </code></div>
    <h2>6. Textarea, Select, Checkbox & Radio</h2>
    <div class="code-box"><code>
<span class="comment" style="color:#94a3b8">/* Textarea - Big message box */</span><br>
<span class="tag">textarea</span> <span class="text">{</span><br>
&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class="attr">width</span><span class="text">:</span> <span class="val">100%</span><span class="text">;</span><br>
&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class="attr">padding</span><span class="text">:</span> <span class="val">12px</span><span class="text">;</span><br>
&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class="attr">border</span><span class="text">:</span> <span class="val">2px solid #e2e8f0</span><span class="text">;</span><br>
&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class="attr">border-radius</span><span class="text">:</span> <span class="val">8px</span><span class="text">;</span><br>
&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class="attr">resize</span><span class="text">:</span> <span class="val">vertical</span><span class="text">;</span> <span class="comment" style="color:#94a3b8">/* Only vertical resize */</span><br>
<span class="text">}</span><br><br>
<span class="comment" style="color:#94a3b8">/* Select - Dropdown */</span><br>
<span class="tag">select</span> <span class="text">{</span><br>
&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class="attr">width</span><span class="text">:</span> <span class="val">100%</span><span class="text">;</span><br>
&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class="attr">padding</span><span class="text">:</span> <span class="val">12px</span><span class="text">;</span><br>
&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class="attr">border</span><span class="text">:</span> <span class="val">2px solid #e2e8f0</span><span class="text">;</span><br>
&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class="attr">border-radius</span><span class="text">:</span> <span class="val">8px</span><span class="text">;</span><br>
&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class="attr">background</span><span class="text">:</span> <span class="val">white</span><span class="text">;</span><br>
<span class="text">}</span><br><br>
<span class="comment" style="color:#94a3b8">/* Checkbox & Radio - Bigger size */</span><br>
<span class="tag">input[type="checkbox"]</span><span class="text">,</span> <span class="tag">input[type="radio"]</span> <span class="text">{</span><br>
&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class="attr">width</span><span class="text">:</span> <span class="val">18px</span><span class="text">;</span><br>
&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class="attr">height</span><span class="text">:</span> <span class="val">18px</span><span class="text">;</span><br>
&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class="attr">accent-color</span><span class="text">:</span> <span class="val">#2563eb</span><span class="text">;</span> <span class="comment" style="color:#94a3b8">/* Blue tick */</span><br>
<span class="text">}</span>
    </code></div>
    <div class="result"><b>Result - Try All:</b><label class="demo-label">Your Message:</label><textarea class="demo-textarea" rows="3" placeholder="Write your message here..."></textarea><label class="demo-label">Your City:</label><select class="demo-select"><option>Select City</option><option>Lahore</option><option>Karachi</option><option>Islamabad</option><option>Multan</option></select><p style="margin:12px 0 0"><label style="cursor:pointer"><input type="checkbox" checked style="width:18px;height:18px;accent-color:#2563eb"> I agree to terms</label></p><p style="margin:8px 0 0"><label style="cursor:pointer"><input type="radio" name="gender" checked style="width:18px;height:18px;accent-color:#2563eb"> Male</label> &nbsp; <label style="cursor:pointer"><input type="radio" name="gender" style="width:18px;height:18px;accent-color:#2563eb"> Female</label></p></div>
    <h2>7. Form Layout - 2 Columns on Desktop, 1 Column on Mobile</h2>
    <div class="code-box"><code>
<span class="tag">.form-row</span> <span class="text">{</span><br>
&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class="attr">display</span><span class="text">:</span> <span class="val">flex</span><span class="text">;</span><br>
&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class="attr">gap</span><span class="text">:</span> <span class="val">15px</span><span class="text">;</span><br>
<span class="text">}</span><br>
<span class="tag">.form-group</span> <span class="text">{</span> <span class="attr">flex</span><span class="text">:</span> <span class="val">1</span><span class="text">;</span> <span class="text">}</span><br><br>
<span class="tag">@media</span> <span class="text">(</span><span class="attr">max-width</span><span class="text">:</span> <span class="val">700px</span><span class="text">)</span> <span class="text">{</span><br>
&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class="tag">.form-row</span> <span class="text">{</span> <span class="attr">flex-direction</span><span class="text">:</span> <span class="val">column</span><span class="text">;</span> <span class="text">}</span><br>
<span class="text">}</span>
    </code></div>
    <div class="result"><b>Result - First Name + Last Name Side by Side:</b><div style="display:flex;gap:12px"><div style="flex:1"><label class="demo-label">First Name:</label><input class="demo-input" type="text" placeholder="Ali"></div><div style="flex:1"><label class="demo-label">Last Name:</label><input class="demo-input" type="text" placeholder="Khan"></div></div></div>
    <h2>8. Full Example - Complete Contact Form</h2>
    <div class="result"><div style="background:white;border:1px solid #e2e8f0;border-radius:12px;padding:20px;max-width:500px;margin:0 auto"><h3 style="text-align:center;margin:0">Contact Us</h3><p style="text-align:center;color:#64748b;margin:5px 0 10px">We will reply within 24 hours</p><label class="demo-label">Full Name:</label><input class="demo-input" type="text" placeholder="Enter your name"><label class="demo-label">Email:</label><input class="demo-input" type="email" placeholder="example@gmail.com"><label class="demo-label">Message:</label><textarea class="demo-textarea" rows="3" placeholder="Write your message..."></textarea><button class="btn" style="width:100%">Send Message →</button></div></div>
    <h2>9. Homework - Practice for 2 Minutes</h2>
    <p>In Playground, make this:</p>
    <p>1. One <b>Contact Form</b> - Name input + Email input + Message textarea + Send button (full width)<br>2. Style <b>input:focus</b> - blue border + light blue glow<br>3. Style <b>label</b> - bold, block, margin-bottom 5px<br>4. Make <b>First Name + Last Name</b> side by side with flex</p>
    <div class="box"><b>Remember:</b> input { width: 100%; padding: 12px; border: 2px solid #e2e8f0; border-radius: 8px; outline: none; } | :focus = Style when clicked | box-shadow = Glow effect | ::placeholder = Hint text color | label { display: block; font-weight: bold; } | textarea { resize: vertical; } | accent-color = Checkbox / Radio color | Form Row = display: flex; gap: 15px;</div>
    <p><b>Next Step:</b> After this lesson, go to <a href="/lesson20">Lesson 20 - CSS Project</a> to combine everything - Box Model + Flexbox + Grid + Buttons + Forms in one real project.</p>
    <a id="playgroundLink" class="btn" href="/playground">▶ Try it Yourself - Playground</a><br><br>
