      <h2>📝 Lesson 19 Test - Check Your Learning</h2>
      <div class="test-info"><b>Total Questions:</b> 10 &nbsp; | &nbsp; <b>Total Marks:</b> 100 &nbsp; | &nbsp; <b>Passing Marks:</b> 80 (80%) &nbsp; | &nbsp; <b>Time:</b> 3 Minutes<br>Each correct answer = 10 Marks. Once you start, all tabs will be locked until you submit.</div>
      <div id="startScreen">
