      </div>
      <div id="timerBar">⏰ Time Left: <span id="timerText">03:00</span></div>
      <div id="quizArea">
        <form id="quizForm">
          <div class="question"><b>Q1. What does :focus mean?</b><label><input type="radio" name="q1" value="a"> Style when user clicks inside input</label><label><input type="radio" name="q1" value="b"> Style when page loads</label><label><input type="radio" name="q1" value="c"> Style when mouse hovers</label><label><input type="radio" name="q1" value="d"> Style always</label></div>
          <div class="question"><b>Q2. Which property removes default black border on focus?</b><label><input type="radio" name="q2" value="a"> outline: none;</label><label><input type="radio" name="q2" value="b"> border: none;</label><label><input type="radio" name="q2" value="c"> focus: none;</label><label><input type="radio" name="q2" value="d"> shadow: none;</label></div>
          <div class="question"><b>Q3. Which property creates Glow effect on focus?</b><label><input type="radio" name="q3" value="a"> box-shadow: 0 0 0 3px #dbeafe;</label><label><input type="radio" name="q3" value="b"> border: glow;</label><label><input type="radio" name="q3" value="c"> glow: blue;</label><label><input type="radio" name="q3" value="d"> shadow: glow;</label></div>
